Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:54:59 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] brand: project .harmonika dirs, Y/N/L upgrade prompt with
 changelog

- config/discovery.ts reads Brand.projectDirs (.harmonika then .opencode) for project
  config directories instead of the hardcoded upstream name.
- mcp/add.ts prefers config.json/harmonika.json and scans every project dir.
- plan plugin adopts .harmonika for new installs but keeps an existing .opencode/plan.
- retained-image and updater recognise the branded install path.
- upgrade shows the manifest changelog, then asks [Y] Yes / [N] No / [L] Later; non-TTY
  sessions proceed automatically. Later writes a marker that surfaces as a startup
  reminder and is cleared once the upgrade lands.
